# AB-010: Reverse a buffer ratio while holding its total pool constant
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.0018mol
add v1 NaOAc 0.0002mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.0002mol
add v2 NaOAc 0.0018mol
measure v2 ph
inspect
